Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 19:41:31 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): the Stock page shows the models' size and extents

Above the stock fields the page now reads "Models: X x Y x Z" and the
models' X/Y/Z extents in the document's units - the box Fit to Models
wraps - so stock can be sized against the part by hand.

Fixes #197

